<title>UK: Indian passes at tender for palm olein - traders.</title>
<headline>Indian passes at tender for palm olein - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's State Trading Corporation (STC) passed at its tender for palm olein on Friday, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>The STC had been seeking 12,000 tonnes of palm olein for October/November shipment.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
